   this plate says exactly that and offers the page where people are managed. It does NOT show a
   staff directory pretending to be a duty roster, and it does not show a zero: a station with no
   roster and no handset is not a station with nobody on it.
   → the roster/presence model is not built; see the Team surface for who exists. #}
